  "report": {
    "uncertain": [
      "weapon:拡散構造相転移砲: kept Jigoku 'Spread Phase-Shift Cannon' (current); battle voice g159 says 'Diffusion Phase Cannon' -- the two disagree, one should be aligned.",
      "weapon:グリーフバニッシャー: no voice/Jigoku source; chose 'Grief Banisher' (English sense) over the literal 'Grief Vanisher'.",
      "weapon:ギーグ・ガン: no source found; 'Geeg Gun' is a romanization guess (could be 'Geek Gun').",
      "weapon:バーレイバー・サイズ: no source found; 'Barlaver Scythe' is a romanization guess for バーレイバー.",
      "weapon:パルシア・スマッシャー: read as Greek parousia ('Advent', fits the Angeloi's Greek naming: Metanoia, Stauros, Pneuma) -> 'Parousia Smasher'.",
      "weapon:カリス・シュート: Greek charis -> 'Charis Shoot', not the glossary pilot name Carris; シュート kept as 'Shoot' (Jigoku ダンブレードシュート = Dan Blade Shoot) to stay distinct from ショット = Shot.",
      "weapon:相克・極 / weapon:太極・滅 (Vildark): romanized like the Sidereal kanji attacks (Jigoku 尸獄門 Shigokumon, robot 尸冥爪・絶 Shimeisou Zetsu); 太極 uses glossary 'Taiji'. A translated option would be 'Conflict: Ultimate' / 'Taiji: Annihilation'.",
      "weapon:葬爪: battle voice g321 translates it 'Funeral Claw' while Kishuku's other attacks are romanized (Kikoushou, Meiseikou); followed the voice. 葬爪・絶 = 'Funeral Claw Zetsu' after robot 尸冥爪・絶 = Shimeisou Zetsu.",
      "weapon:ニトロハーケン: followed voice 'Nitro Haken' although Code Geass Slash Harken is spelled 'Harken' in Jigoku.",
      "weapon:カマ (Eva Mark.09): 'Scythe' vs 'Sickle' is a guess.",
      "Short forms coined: RW Surger family, LP Blast/Maser/Blade family (光粒子 may appear in other briefs; keep 'LP' there), HD Transfer Cannon, The Unbr. Fulcrum, Nibelung Annih., Balmung Elim."
    ],
    "notes": "Owners resolved via wpn-1r + ridwpidx (code -> robot record). Voice-matched: Pinion Halberd, Nibelung Annihilation, Nitro Haken, Hound Penetrator, Balmung Elimination, The Overriser Arc, GS Combat Action (glossary), Bunmer Spanner, Pain Shouter, Riot Jarenti (glossary, Bandai official), The Heat Crusher, Bayonet Spiker, The Unbreakable Fulcrum, MDQ Missile, DEC Impulse Cannon, Hyperdimensional Transfer Cannon, Kikoushou, Meiseikou, Funeral Claw, Photon Torpedo, Plasma Launcher, Deflector Beam. Jigoku reuse: Volley Fire -> Missile Volley."
  }
